 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"What's the worst thing you've done since the sky changed?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "No judgment in their face. \"We're all doing math that doesn't add up. You're still here. That counts.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"If I may — I don't answer that one myself. Not yet. Maybe when I've decided whether surviving counts as an excuse or just a reason.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Between us — Still on the worst thing you've done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Jenny owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I greet everyone by name each morning at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Jenny. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"I've been turning something over. What do YOU think actually happened to us? Mark my words.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"That's where I keep landing too. The question is what it wants.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"My theory changes weekly. This week's: we're the control group. Somewhere there's a village that got instructions, and we're the ones they just... watched. Cheerful thought, right? It'll pass.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Still on what you think happened to us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Yes. Absolutely. I've been hoping you'd ask.\" (A little too quickly.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Ha.\" Not amused. \"I wasn't a surgeon. I was a barber. I wasn't protecting myself. I was protecting someone else. There. You happy?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Mateo rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Mateo looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Mateo sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"About that question — Did you sleep? I kept hearing things out past the treeline. ...if that makes sense.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They go still. \"So it's not just me. Good. That's... good to know. Bad, but good.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The warmth pulls back a notch. They're weighing something."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Still on how you slept.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling Rut King? Piper is pushing 'Ugly-Eyes'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You show them Chickweed — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"About that question — Do you ever just need to be alone? Like, really alone? Give it time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I get it. Solitude's a resource too. Scarcer than food, some days. No point pretending otherwise.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Whatever warmth was building cools to politeness."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Still on needing to be alone!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? Seen worse.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about Rut King last night — what to even CALL it. 'Big-Eyes' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"About that question — What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "The ease drains out of it, a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on what got you through the first week.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up, as it were?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"The Quiet Room. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I know who took the extra rations but won't say. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "At the tree line the ground is torn up. Something was here, recently, and it wasn't careful. Mateo's hand finds your sleeve. You leave together, faster than you came."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took you — The Quiet Room, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
